tests/.tmp/
# Local test environment (.lizhu_env/): TRACK its sources - the Playwright
# browser specs and the harness config (playwright/vite/package) - but never
# its dependencies or run artifacts. The blanket `.lizhu_env/` ignore this
# replaces also hid the round-5 machine spec, which then could not be tracked
# at all. Patterns below are runtime-artifact patterns, not directory-level
# ones, so a newly added spec is picked up by `git status` immediately.
.lizhu_env/node_modules/
.lizhu_env/e2e/node_modules/
.lizhu_env/e2e/test-results/
.lizhu_env/e2e/shots/
.lizhu_env/e2e/report.json
.lizhu_env/*.log
.lizhu_env/probe.txt